---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Accessibility | Pluribus Inc"
  description="Pluribus Inc.'s accessibility statement — our commitment to WCAG 2.1 AA conformance and how to reach us with accessibility feedback."
>
  <section class="section section--deep">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Accessibility</span>
      <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Pluribus is committed to a website that everyone can use — regardless of ability or
        technology.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Our commitment</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to conform to the
        <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/" rel="noopener">Web Content Accessibility
        Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</a>. These guidelines explain how to make web content more
        accessible to people with a wide range of disabilities, and conformance also aligns with
        the accessibility expectations of the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and Section
        508.
      </p>

      <h2>What we've built in</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic HTML landmarks, headings, and lists on every page</li>
        <li>A "skip to main content" link and full keyboard operability, including the mobile menu</li>
        <li>Visible focus indicators on all interactive elements</li>
        <li>Text alternatives for meaningful images; decorative images are hidden from assistive technology</li>
        <li>Color contrast meeting or exceeding WCAG AA ratios in both dark and light sections</li>
        <li>Reduced-motion support that honors your system preference</li>
        <li>Content that reflows for screen magnification and small viewports</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Known limitations</h2>
      <p>
        This site is under active development. Some imagery originating from design mockups may be
        replaced with final photography, and any remaining issues found in auditing will be
        addressed before launch.
      </p>

      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter an accessibility barrier on this site, please tell us. Email
        <a href="mailto:info@pluribusdata.com?subject=Accessibility%20feedback">
          info@pluribusdata.com
        </a>
        or call <a href="tel:+15713804740">571-380-4740</a>, and we will work with you to provide
        the information or service you need in an accessible way.
      </p>

      <p><em>This statement was last reviewed on July 20, 2026.</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
